{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "conversationId": "dynamo_mo&krill_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Mo. Krill.  If we get our timing down I am confident that we can make their lives a living hell.",
          "duration": 6.004
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "We will endeavor not to grab someone in your black hole.",
          "duration": 3.869
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "And I'll try not to drop a black hole on someone you grabbed.",
          "duration": 2.85
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "dynamo_mo&krill_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "Gentlemen, you're both well connected individuals right?",
          "duration": 2.861
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "We have lived quite the life, yes.",
          "duration": 2.513
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "My anniversary is coming  up and I was really hoping to get Marla something special.",
          "duration": 4.465
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_04.mp3",
          "text": "What are you thinking? Jewels, fine art, Ixian trickets?",
          "duration": 4.367
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_05.mp3",
          "text": "She's a big reader so I was thinking a rare book.",
          "duration": 3.624
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_06.mp3",
          "text": "My friend, what if I told you I knew someone looking to move a first edition Don Quixote",
          "duration": 5.464
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_07",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_07.mp3",
          "text": "I would be very excited, then remind you that I have a teacher's salary.",
          "duration": 4.248
        },
        {
          "order": 8,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_08",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_dynamo_krill_convo03_08.mp3",
          "text": "That does make it a challenge, but one I gladly accept.  I will find you options.",
          "duration": 6.062
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "dynamo_mirage_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "I have wanted to speak to a djinn for quite some time, I imagine they are a facisning people.",
          "duration": 4.847
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mirage",
          "audioFile": "mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "They're people.  Some are facsinating, some are\u2026are\u2026",
          "duration": 7.237
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "banal?",
          "duration": 0.654
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mirage",
          "audioFile": "mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "What does that word mean?",
          "duration": 1.507
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_05.mp3",
          "text": "It\u2019s a fancy way of saying boring.",
          "duration": 2.126
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Mirage",
          "audioFile": "mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_06.mp3",
          "text": "No.  That's not it.   What do you say when somone is cruel as child would be",
          "duration": 6.668
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "character": "Dynamo",
          "audioFile": "dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_07",
          "audioUrl": "audio/dynamo_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_07.mp3",
          "text": "Asshole.",
          "duration": 0.783
        },
        {
          "order": 8,
          "character": "Mirage",
          "audioFile": "mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_08",
          "audioUrl": "audio/mirage_match_start_dynamo_mirage_convo01_08.mp3",
          "text": "Yes!  Asshole.  Some are facinating.  Some are assholes.",
          "duration": 6.248
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}